{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人蘇韻姿、朱智賢、簡淑兒、劉溫馨和陳沛汶一向感情要好，但竟然大打出手，女人打起上來極度凶恨，說的其實是她們自行創作的fighting style搞笑短片，並配文：「不敢相信，他們竟然真的做到了，我們確實有各自的戰斗風格。</p><p>」&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:28:27.674749+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.814708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.814708+00:00","content_hash":"ec2c93d527a91b80e000bf2fe8c47e24d68776d267dee17853c154fc0b327333","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}